# Chocolate Peanut Butter Bundt Cake

Based on [https://www.lovefromtheoven.com/chocolate-peanut-butter-bundt-cake/…](https://www.lovefromtheoven.com/chocolate-peanut-butter-bundt-cake) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251119223501/https://www.lovefromtheoven.com/chocolate-peanut-butter-bundt-cake/))

{ rating="2" image="chocolate_peanut_butter_bundt_cake.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] [Cake]{ ing="cake" }

      - [ ] [chocolate cake mix]{ ing="chocolate-cake-mix" }
      - [ ] 1 oz package [chocolate pudding]{ ing="chocolate-pudding" } (TBD-see note)
      - [ ] 1 cup [sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" }
      - [ ] 1 cup [vegetable oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" }
      - [ ] 4 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
      - [ ] 1/2 cup [warm water]{ ing="warm-water" }
      - [ ] 1/2 cup [peanut butter chips]{ ing="peanut-butter-chips" } (optional)
- [ ] [Peanut Butter Filling]{ ing="peanut-butter-filling" }

      - [ ] 1 cup [creamy peanut butter]{ ing="creamy-peanut-butter" }
      - [ ] 1/3 cup [powdered sugar]{ ing="powdered-sugar" }
      - [ ] 4 Tbsp [butter melted]{ ing="butter-melted" }
      - [ ] 1 tsp [vanilla extract]{ ing="vanilla-extract" }
      - [ ] 1/8 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] [Glaze]{ ing="glaze" }

      - [ ] See recipe: [‘Chocolate Peanut Butter Glaze’](./chocolate_peanut_butter_glaze.html)

## Recipe

1. Preheat oven to 350
1. Combine all of the [cake]{ ing="cake" } ingredients and [mix]{ ing="chocolate-cake-mix" } with a mixer until combined. Avoid over mixing
1. For the [filling]{ ing="peanut-butter-filling" }, in a separate bowl, combine [peanut butter]{ ing="creamy-peanut-butter" }, butter, [powdered sugar]{ ing="powdered-sugar" }, vanilla and [salt]{ ing="salt" }. [Mix]{ ing="chocolate-cake-mix" } well with mixer
1. Spray a bundt [cake]{ ing="cake" } pan with non-stick cooking spray. Spoon half of cake mixture. Then spoon [peanut butter filling]{ ing="peanut-butter-filling" } on top of the cake batter. Top with remaining cake batter
1. Bake for 50-55 minutes or until toothpick inserted into [cake]{ ing="cake" } comes out clean
1. Remove from oven and allow to cool on a wire rack
1. Once cool, place the wire rack on top of the bundt pan, flip, and allow the [cake]{ ing="cake" } to release
1. Spoon or pour [glaze]{ ing="glaze" } over [cake]{ ing="cake" } and/or top with [powdered sugar]{ ing="powdered-sugar" }

## Notes

1. The pudding adds an odd, gelatinous texture. Probably could exclude it without too much issue
